#. Description of the plugin
#: wm-kanzlei-ai-sanitizer.php
msgid ""
"Replaces court file numbers, IBANs, e-mail addresses, tax IDs, phone "
"numbers, names after a title and amounts in a text with placeholders and "
"puts them back into the answer; REST routes, WP-CLI, an admin simulator and "
"an HMAC-chained log. Sends nothing to AI providers."
msgstr ""
"Pakeičia teismo bylų numerius, IBAN, el. pašto adresus, mokesčių ID, "
"telefono numerius, vardus po kreipinio ir pinigų sumas tekste vietos žymomis "
"ir grąžina juos į atsakymą; REST maršrutai, WP-CLI, administravimo "
"simuliatorius ir HMAC grandine susietas žurnalas. Nieko nesiunčia DI "
"tiekėjams."

#. Author of the plugin
#: wm-kanzlei-ai-sanitizer.php
msgid "Arnold Wender"
msgstr "Arnold Wender"

